  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This allocation contributes to meeting the objectives of the Humanitarian Response Plan (HRP) for Mali 2022 and UNFPA&#x2019;s Mali appeal 2022.

Mali is hit by an alarming and worsening humanitarian crisis. This allocation contributes to meeting the objectives of the Humanitarian  Response Plan (HRP) for Mali 2022 and UNFPA&#x2019;s Mali appeal 2022 of 3.5 million USD, of which only around one third is funded. UNFPA&#x2019;s activities in Mali include GBV and SRH services. 

Due to its nature as a response to a humanitarian appeal operational results are general and highly aggregated and the MFA contribution is thus reflected in the overall results reporting by the partner.  Please refer to the hyperlink below.

https://www.unfpa.org/publications</narrative>
  </description>
